        <mxCell id="userdata-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Per-app ASG (ver pagina &#39;ASG Lifecycle&#39;):&lt;/b&gt; TG + listener rules, Application AMI (IIS/DNN baked). &lt;b&gt;Scaling:&lt;/b&gt; Target Tracking por ALBRequestCountPerTarget (no CPU). &lt;b&gt;Health check:&lt;/b&gt; ELB, grace 1200s; default_instance_warmup 900s; Instance Refresh Rolling (min healthy 50%, warmup 1200s). &lt;b&gt;Lifecycle hooks:&lt;/b&gt; launch-ready (LAUNCHING, 1800s, ABANDON) + leave-domain (TERMINATING, 300s, CONTINUE). &lt;b&gt;Root:&lt;/b&gt; gp3 KMS-encrypted." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;fillColor=#FFF2CC;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=8;fontColor=#333333;spacingLeft=4;spacingTop=2;" parent="app-tier" vertex="1">
